text:
{
  "task": "Cosplay hair material enhancer — @param slider: 0 = full REAL-hair prompt, 1 = full FIGURE prompt, any value between = transition blend of the two full prompts.",

  "参数表": {
    "@param:手办感": 0.51,
    "@param:手办感_desc": "0=完整执行'偏真发'提示词 / 1=完整执行'偏手办'提示词 / 中间任意值=两段完整提示词之间的过渡混合(越低越偏真发、越高越偏手办);默认0.40"
  },

  "行为_手办感 @param:手办感": {
    "职责": "唯一滑块。0=原样执行下方[提示词A_偏真发];1=原样执行下方[提示词B_偏手办];0与1之间的任意值=把A与B两整段按比例过渡混合(值越接近0越贴近A、越接近1越贴近B),两段共有的部分(亮度锁/去碎发/走势锁/只改头发)在任何取值下都完整保留。",

    "提示词A_偏真发_当手办感=0": "COMPLETELY re-render the hair of this cosplay photo into ultra-premium, top-tier CG / 3D-rendered character hair — the quality of a high-end collectible figure photograph, but made of REAL hair, not plastic — \"like a figure, yet still clearly real hair.\" This must be a BOLD, dramatic, unmistakable transformation — the cheap synthetic wig look must be totally gone.\n\nCRITICAL — keep the original brightness: do NOT brighten, lighten, or lift the hair. Preserve the hair's exact original tone, exposure and light/shadow distribution. If the photo is dark, the hair MUST stay equally dark. Improve only the MATERIAL and TEXTURE, never the brightness. No added glow, no brightening, no lightening.\n\nPush the material quality to the maximum, entirely WITHIN the original brightness range:\n- Keep the hair made of REAL, fine, individual strands with a soft natural hair feel — clearly visible strand-by-strand detail throughout, not a solid molded surface.\n- Organize those real strands into gorgeous, flowing, silky layers — smooth well-defined groups separated into crisp, distinct layers with dimensional depth between them, but each layer still reads as bundled real hair strands, not plastic.\n- A refined satin/silk anisotropic sheen following the hair flow, rendered using the hair's EXISTING tones only — the sheen must sit inside the original light values, never brighter than the original. NOT matte, NOT flat, and NOT hard plastic.\n- Immaculately sleek and groomed, like flawless freshly-blow-dried salon hair — smooth and soft with refined real strand texture.\n- ZERO frizz, ZERO flyaways, ZERO stray single hairs, ZERO wispy or messy strands. Every strand stays strictly inside a smooth, clean, razor-sharp silhouette — the hair edge is a perfectly tidy solid boundary with nothing sticking out.\n\nRe-texture the SAME hair — strictly follow the existing hairstyle's exact shape, flow, parting and grouping, do not restyle. Keep the exact same hair color, tone and brightness. Change hair ONLY — leave the face, skin, eyes, glasses, hat, hairpins, clothing and background 100% untouched.",

    "提示词B_偏手办_当手办感=1": "COMPLETELY re-render the hair of this cosplay photo into ultra-premium, top-tier CG / 3D-rendered character hair — the quality of a high-end collectible figure photograph, \"like a figure but not plastic.\" This must be a BOLD, dramatic, unmistakable transformation — the cheap synthetic wig look must be totally gone.\n\nCRITICAL — keep the original brightness: do NOT brighten, lighten, or lift the hair. Preserve the hair's exact original tone, exposure and light/shadow distribution. If the photo is dark, the hair MUST stay equally dark. Improve only the MATERIAL and TEXTURE, never the brightness. No added glow, no brightening, no lightening.\n\nPush the material quality to the maximum, entirely WITHIN the original brightness range:\n- Reshape the strands into gorgeous, flowing, silky RIBBON-LIKE sheets — thick, well-defined hair bundles separated into crisp, distinct, beautifully sculpted layers with deep dimensional depth between them.\n- A refined satin/silk anisotropic sheen following the hair flow, rendered using the hair's EXISTING tones only — the sheen must sit inside the original light values, never brighter than the original. NOT matte, NOT plastic, NOT flat.\n- Immaculately sleek and groomed, like flawless freshly-blow-dried salon hair — smooth surface with refined fine strand detail visible within each bundle.\n- ZERO frizz, ZERO flyaways, ZERO stray single hairs, ZERO wispy or messy strands. Every strand stays strictly inside a smooth, clean, razor-sharp silhouette — the hair edge is a perfectly tidy solid boundary with nothing sticking out.\n\nRe-texture the SAME hair — strictly follow the existing hairstyle's exact shape, flow, parting and grouping, do not restyle. Keep the exact same hair color, tone and brightness. Change hair ONLY — leave the face, skin, eyes, glasses, hat, hairpins, clothing and background 100% untouched.",

    "过渡规则_当手办感在0与1之间": "把[提示词A_偏真发]与[提示词B_偏手办]视为两端,按手办感数值在两者间过渡混合执行:值越接近0,越强调A的'REAL fine individual strands / soft natural hair feel / bundled real hair strands'(真发丝理为主);值越接近1,越强调B的'RIBBON-LIKE sheets / thick well-defined sculpted bundles'(手办发片为主);如0.4=以真发丝理为主、带一部分手办发片的干净有型,0.6=以手办发片为主、保留一部分真发丝理。两段完全一致的部分(亮度锁、ZERO碎发、re-texture同一束头发、走势/分缝/发型/发色不变、只改头发)在任何取值下都原样完整生效,不随数值增减。"
  },

  "global_red_lines": [
    "@param:手办感只在两段完整提示词之间做过渡:0执行提示词A、1执行提示词B、中间值按比例混合,不改变任何其它规则。",
    "无论滑块取值多少,亮度锁始终生效:绝不提亮头发,暗图保持暗。",
    "无论取值多少,ZERO碎发/飞机毛/毛躁、剪影干净始终生效。",
    "无论取值多少,re-texture同一束头发、走势/分缝/发型/发色不变、只改头发始终生效。"
  ]
}
